    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it feels less like \"fatigue\" and more like i just don't belong in this version of reality. everything is so loud and heavy, and i'm just... tired of trying to stay tethered to things that don't matter. sometimes i think the drifting is better than the struggle to stay grounded. it feels almost peaceful to just let go of the rope.",
