      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just don't see the point in a professional \"distinguishing\" anything. it's not a numbness i'm trying to fix, it's the weight of existing. if the drifting is actually more peaceful, why is it considered something that needs to be stopped? it seems more logical to just... accept the drift instead of fighting it.",
